{title: Sing Joyfully!}
{artist: Gilberto Barreto}
{key: G}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 97}

Intro
[G] [G/C] [G] [G/C] [G] [G/C] [D7]

Verse 1
Sing [G]joyfully to the [G/C]Lord, you [G]righteous; [G/C]
It is [G]fitting for the [G/C]upright to praise [F/D]him. [F/G] [G7]

Chorus
[Cmaj7]Praise the Lord,
Make [C/D]music to him.
[Bm7]Sing to him [F]a new [E]song.
Play [Am7]skillfully and [C/D]shout for joy,
and [Gmaj7]shout for joy. [F/G] [G7]
[Cmaj7]Praise the Lord,
Make [C/D]music to him.
[Bm7]Sing to him [F]a new [E]song.
Play [Am7]skillfully and [C/D]shout for joy,
and [Gmaj7]shout for joy. [D7]

Verse 2
The [G]Lord loves [G/C]righteousness and [G]justice. [G/C]
The [G]Earth is full of [G/C]his unfailing [F/D]love. [F/G] [G7]

Chorus
[Cmaj7]Praise the Lord,
Make [C/D]music to him.
[Bm7]Sing to him [F]a new [E]song.
Play [Am7]skillfully and [C/D]shout for joy,
and [Gmaj7]shout for joy. [F/G] [G7]
[Cmaj7]Praise the Lord,
Make [C/D]music to him.
[Bm7]Sing to him [F]a new [E]song.
Play [Am7]skillfully and [C/D]shout for joy,
and [Gmaj7]shout for joy. [D7]

Chorus
[Cmaj7]Praise the Lord,
Make [C/D]music to him.
[Bm7]Sing to him [F]a new [E]song.
Play [Am7]skillfully and [C/D]shout for joy,
and [Gmaj7]shout for joy. [F/G] [G7]
[Cmaj7]Praise the Lord,
Make [C/D]music to him.
[Bm7]Sing to him [F]a new [E]song.
Play [Am7]skillfully and [C/D]shout for joy,
and [Gmaj7]shout for joy. [D7]

Ending
Play [Am7]skillfully and [C/D]shout for joy,
and [Gmaj7]shout for joy. [Em]
Play [Am7]skillfully and [C/D]shout for joy,
and [Gmaj7]shout for joy. [Gmaj7]
